        "text_JKjFAM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>At Artisan Rug Gallery, we are more than just a purveyor of rugs. We are connoisseurs of comfort, champions of craftsmanship, and devotees of design. Our mission is to not only provide superior rugs and carpets but also to foster a deep appreciation for the artistry and beauty that rugs bring to our lives.</h4>",
